msgid "Flow"
msgstr "流向"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2416
msgid ""
"For a responsive table on a weak device, keep Limit at 250 rows or below. "
"The weak-device cap affects rendered rows; the buffer can still retain more."
msgstr ""
"要让弱设备上的表格保持响应，请将 行数限制 保持在 250 行或更少。弱设备限制影响"
"渲染的行数；缓冲区仍可保留更多行。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:61
msgid "Forwarded"
msgstr "已转发"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-fwlive.json:3
msgid "Grant access to firewall live log view"
msgstr "授予防火墙实时日志视图的访问权限"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2389
msgid "Help"
msgstr "帮助"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1548
msgid "Hide rows"
msgstr "隐藏行"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1603
msgid ""
"High event rate — table refresh is throttled to protect the browser. The "
"buffer still updates; refresh will resume automatically."
msgstr ""
"事件速率过高 — 已限制表格刷新以保护浏览器。缓冲区仍在更新；刷新将自动恢复。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1448
msgid "Hostname resolve paused while the router is under load."
msgstr "路由器负载较高，已暂停主机名解析。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1827
msgid "ICMPv6"
msgstr "ICMPv6"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:40
msgid "IN"
msgstr "IN"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2453
msgid ""
"If Row tint looks missing, the active LuCI theme may omit success/error or "
"info/warn CSS variables; fwlive falls back to local colors (air-gapped, no "
"data leaves the device)."
msgstr ""
"如果行着色看起来缺失，当前 LuCI 主题可能未提供成功/错误或信息/警告 CSS 变量；"
"fwlive 会回退到本地颜色（隔离运行，数据不会离开本设备）。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:331
msgid ""
"If the WAN is quiet, wait for probes or use the optional ping check in "
"Help / the enabling-logs guide."
msgstr ""
"如果 WAN 侧较安静，请等待探测报文，或使用「帮助」/启用日志指南中的可选 ping "
"检查。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:59
msgid "Inbound"
msgstr "入站"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/chips.js:93
msgid "Include instead"
msgstr "改为包含"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:296
msgid ""
"Install kmod-nf-log and kmod-nf-log6 with the command for your OpenWrt "
"release, then reload the firewall."
msgstr ""
"请使用适用于您 OpenWrt 版本的命令安装 kmod-nf-log 和 kmod-nf-log6，"
"然后重新加载防火墙。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1653
